#. Confirmation text shown after a user submits a moderation report.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report/ReportStepComplete.tsx
msgid "Thank you for helping keep {productName} safe. We'll review your report as soon as possible."
msgstr "Dėkojame, kad padedate užtikrinti „{productName}“ saugumą. Jūsų pranešimą peržiūrėsime kuo greičiau."

#. Report flow: title of the final screen when the chosen answer does not lead to a report, so nothing was sent. Thanks the person for raising it.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report_flow/ReportFlowCopy.ts
msgid "Thanks for flagging this"
msgstr "Ačiū, kad atkreipėte į tai dėmesį"

#. Report flow: body of the final screen when the chosen answer does not lead to a report, so nothing was sent. Used when the reporter already picked a category.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report_flow/ReportFlowCopy.ts
msgid "Thanks for telling us. This doesn't break our rules on its own, so we didn't send a report."
msgstr "Dėkojame, kad mums pranešėte. Tai savaime nepažeidžia mūsų taisyklių, todėl pranešimo nesiuntėme."

#. Report flow: body of the final screen when the chosen answer does not lead to a report, so nothing was sent. "Abusive or harmful content" is the name of an answer in the same flow.
#: src/features/moderation/components/report_flow/ReportFlowCopy.ts
msgid "Thanks for telling us. This doesn't break our rules on its own, so we didn't send a report. If it targets someone or uses slurs, report it again and choose Abusive or harmful content."
msgstr "Dėkojame, kad mums pranešėte. Tai savaime nepažeidžia mūsų taisyklių, todėl pranešimo nesiuntėme. Jei tai nukreipta prieš kokį nors asmenį arba vartojami įžeidžiantys epitetai, praneškite apie tai dar kartą ir pasirinkite „Įžeidžiantis ar žalingas turinys“."

#. Error in the browser when a code typed from the app is not found. instanceHost is the server the browser checked, such as api.fluxer.app. productName is the app name, such as Fluxer.
#: src/features/auth/flow/auth_login_core/useDesktopHandoffFlow.ts
msgid "That code is not valid on {instanceHost}. Check the code in the {productName} app and try again."
msgstr "Šis kodas netinkamas {instanceHost}. Patikrinkite kodą programėlėje {productName} ir bandykite dar kartą."

#. Body of the passkey page after the passkey prompt failed or was dismissed. Keep plain.
#: src/features/auth/passkey_migration/PasskeyBridgePage.tsx
msgid "That didn't work. Try again or cancel."
msgstr "Nepavyko. Pabandykite dar kartą arba atšaukite."

#: src/features/ui/components/form/ColorPickerField.tsx
msgid "That doesn't look like a valid color. Try hex, rgb(), hsl(), or a CSS color name."
msgstr "Panašu, kad tai nėra tinkama spalva. Bandykite šešioliktainį kodą, rgb(), hsl() arba CSS spalvos pavadinimą."

#: src/features/moderation/components/report/ReportStepDetails.tsx
msgid "That doesn't look like a valid URL."
msgstr "Atrodo, tai nėra tinkamas URL."

#. Instance selector error shown when the typed address cannot be an address at all. Example instance domain is interpolated.
